{"ID":"20240314091744-1s17nai","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091744-1s17nai","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091744-1s17nai\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171321-lg6u9mc\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171321-4dsukq2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422171321-4dsukq2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:42,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:42\u0026#125;","title":"【白头翁甘草阿胶汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422171321"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422171321-lg6u9mc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422171321-lg6u9mc","updated":"20240422171321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产后下利虚极，白头翁加甘草阿胶汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171321-2qv4y9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171321-2qv4y9r","updated":"20240422171321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"白头翁加甘草阿胶汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171321-2akm6l3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171321-2akm6l3","updated":"20240422171321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"白头翁甘草阿胶各二两、秦皮黄连柏皮各三两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171321-8gty09w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171321-8gty09w","updated":"20240422171321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右六味，以水七升，煑取二升半，内胶令消尽，分温三服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422171321-8gubsz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171321-8gubsz2","updated":"20240422171321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"接着下来呢，你如果遇到一个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"产后的太太，下利的很严重，人都虚掉了"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，这个白头翁汤呢，是治热痢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"很严重的时候你白头翁呢要加甘草、阿胶"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422171321-v5l8s15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171321-v5l8s15","updated":"20240422171321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白头翁、秦皮、黄连、黄柏这是白头翁汤原方，再加了甘草和阿胶。这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"阿胶呢能够止血也能够补血"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那下利呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"甘草进去能够把肠胃里面的一些宿食分解掉，肠胃里的毒素分解掉，所以它有解毒的功能"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。一般人下利严重，热痢的时候，就是里急后重，上完厕所肛门还很沉重，这个时候就单纯的白头翁汤。就是白头翁，秦皮，黄连跟黄柏，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240422171321-4dsukq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422171321-4dsukq2","updated":"20240422171321"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产后的话，同样的方子加甘草和阿胶，阿胶可以补血。当你要补血的时候呢，阿胶不要去煮它。"}]}]}